## NOTE: User Defined Gitignore Template

## Common Files/Folders to ignore
.DS_Store
__pychache__
node_modules

## Ignore headroom generated files
.tokensave/
.claude/.headroom_wrap_marker.json

## Ignore vscode extension artifacts
*.vsix

## Ignore .npm-cache folder
.npm-cache

## src/packages/pptxdiff-cli/lib/ is a real, tracked Node source directory
## (its package.json's "main" points at lib/index.js) — un-ignore it from
## the py.gitignore template's generic `lib/` rule (meant for Python
## virtualenv-style lib dirs), which would otherwise silently swallow it.
!src/packages/pptxdiff-cli/lib/
!src/packages/pptxdiff-cli/lib/**
